      "lines": [
        "做棱台."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "棱台有两个底面（图 47 中 $ABCDE$ 和 $A_1B_1C_1D_1E_1$），它们",
        "是位似多边形."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "端点在两个底面内且垂直于底面的线段叫做棱台的高.",
        "棱台的侧面都是梯形."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果棱台是正棱锥的一部分，这个棱台就叫正棱台. 正",
        "棱台的侧面是合同的等腰梯形（图 47）. 这些梯形的高，都叫",
        "做正棱台的斜高（在图 47 中的 $[MM_1]$）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "正棱台的一个侧面的面积乘以面数，就得到公式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$S_{\\text{侧}}=\\frac{1}{2}(P+P_1)\\cdot h_{\\text{斜}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "正棱台的侧面积等于两底面周长和的一半乘以斜高."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
